<rml>
<head>
	<!--
		The hover's title label (I3 step 13a; ADR-0012 §3, style §16: a small contextual label): the title of the
		cartridge the reticle rests on in the room (FreeRoam) or of the one in Focus, just above it as the view shows it.
		Bound to the data model "world_label" of rv::app::WorldLabelPanel (src/app/src/world_label_panel.cpp), which also
		names the ids below: keep them in step (src/app/include/rv/app/world_label_ui.hpp,
		tests/unit/app/test_world_label_document.cpp).
		title: the catalog's title, shown as it is (data, not a sentence of the UI); "" for a game the catalog lacks.
		available: false when the game's file is not there. left, bottom, width: the band the label is centred in, in
		pixels of the view (the panel computes them). It takes no input and never the focus.
	-->
	<title>Etichetta</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="world_label.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="world_label">
	<div id="world-label" data-style-left="left" data-style-bottom="bottom" data-style-width="width">
		<span class="label">
			<span data-if="title != ''">{{ title }}</span>
			<span data-if="title == ''">Gioco senza titolo</span>
			<span class="unavailable" data-if="!available"> (file non trovato)</span>
		</span>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
